      "message": "test(multiaxis): pin a basis-0 tilt saved after an angle edit as a limit\n\nA project that a build with defect #2599 saved after an angle edit holds\nbasis 0 with the new angles. The characterisation test shows that such a\nfile posts the plane turned 90 degrees from basis 1, that the preview and\nthe post agree, and that the file is byte for byte the same as a legal,\nnever-edited basis-0 project. No safe load test exists, so no behaviour\nchanges; the decision records the limit and the manual repair.\n\nFixes #2739\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
